A '''gorF''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished in [[Water]] on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}}.

== Spawning ==
A '''gorF''' can be fished up anywhere on the {{Zone|Lotus Atoll}} once the player is {{skill|fishing|10}}. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for a '''gorF''' is {{Green|1,500}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|15%|1|6.67|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. 

